WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,400
I want to look here again

2
00:00:02,020 --> 00:00:03,140
Maybe I can remember something

3
00:00:03,540 --> 00:00:04,460
I'll walk with you for a while

4
00:00:08,550 --> 00:00:10,230
About two thousand people live here now

5
00:00:10,630 --> 00:00:13,230
Security, office, medical and living areas are on the upper floor

6
00:00:13,230 --> 00:00:15,070
Eleventh floor, two thousand people

7
00:00:15,550 --> 00:00:17,550
The entrance is only the first line of defense

8
00:00:17,830 --> 00:00:19,870
There is also independent energy and long-term attack inside

9
00:00:19,950 --> 00:00:21,110
Such a big shelter

10
00:00:21,310 --> 00:00:23,030
Refusing to always confiscate temporary construction

11
00:00:23,430 --> 00:00:24,710
Why did it already exist

12
00:00:25,070 --> 00:00:26,550
And why has it never been made public?
